<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- MANAGEMENT SHARE H1 NET UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE- MANAGEMENT SHARE H1 NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.4  vs   0.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				 6.9  vs   5.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 0.6  vs   0.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Software group Management Share NV said it expected</p>
<p>positive turnover growth trends in the second half of 1997 and</p>
<p>added operating profits were seen rising in line with this.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
